			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 120210804,
					"content": "其实最早的时候，海祇岛的神社并非在珊瑚宫，而是在别的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210805,
					"content": "那里靠近海祇岛的七天神像，当时的海祇岛虽不像幕府那般尊崇将军，但也认可她的存在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210806,
					"content": "但随着那一刀落下，守护我们海祇岛的魔神被斩断之后，当初的神社便废弃了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210807,
					"content": "也从那时起，海祇岛和幕府的关系就变得有些微妙，彼此之间的成见越来越深。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210808,
					"content": "这次和谈，我本来也想好好跟天领奉行讨论一下这个问题。有些恩怨，总有一天要放下的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210809,
					"content": "珊瑚宫大人，今天怎么有空来这边看看了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "用高"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210810,
					"content": "总觉得你的气色比上次差了，平时要照顾好自己，你可是我们最大的依靠…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "用高"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210811,
					"content": "嗯嗯，请放心，没事的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210812,
					"content": "珊瑚宫大人，听我一句劝。咱们跟幕府军打了那么久，可不能说谈就谈啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "结菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210813,
					"content": "要是与他们和解的话，当初守护我们的魔神不就白死了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "结菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210814,
					"content": "行了行了，都什么年代啦。这才刚打完仗呢，安安稳稳地过日子多好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "用高"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210815,
					"content": "我当然知道，只是…唉。至少态度要强硬一些，不能随便妥协。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "结菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210816,
					"content": "我明白的，此事我会再考虑一下，一定会妥善处理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210817,
					"content": "太好了…那就麻烦珊瑚宫大人了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "结菜"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210818,
					"content": "珊瑚宫大人？哎呀呀，没想到能在这里见到您。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志织"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210819,
					"content": "我的女儿，今年报名参加巫女选拔了。要是她能进珊瑚宫就好啦，珊瑚宫大人心善，一定不会亏待她。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志织"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210820,
					"content": "唉，我常和我家女儿说，让她有机会的话跟珊瑚宫大人好好学学。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210821
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志织"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210821,
					"content": "珊瑚宫大人这么年轻，就已经会待人处事，人又聪明伶俐…我家女儿，一直把珊瑚宫大人当做榜样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志织"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210822,
					"content": "如果她能来珊瑚宫的话，我会关照一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210823
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210823,
					"content": "珊瑚宫大人！总算见到您了。关于今年农业减产的问题，我想跟您汇报一下…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210824
					],
					"speakerTitle": "岩田"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210824,
					"content": "#珊瑚宫大人，这位不是剑鱼二番队的队长吗？{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}以后会留在海祇岛吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210825
					],
					"speakerTitle": "亮子"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210825,
					"content": "珊瑚宫大人…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210826
					],
					"speakerTitle": "幸也"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210826,
					"content": "呼…大家稍微静一下，我都会听的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210827
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210827,
					"content": "不过，比较长的问题还是建议写成报告，递到珊瑚宫。有时间我会慢慢批复。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210828
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210828,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210829
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210829,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，你还好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210830,
						120210832
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210830,
					"content": "还好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210831
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120210831,
					"content": "呵呵…看来你很擅长应对这样的场合。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210834,
					"content": "珊瑚宫大人，原来您在这里。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210835
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210835,
					"content": "有件事要向您汇报，我们有一批祭祀用具迟迟没有送到，我担心是被劫走了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210836
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210836,
					"content": "那些东西我已经找回来了，不必担心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210837
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210837,
					"content": "真的吗？不愧是珊瑚宫大人，太厉害了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210838
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210838,
					"content": "最近的公文我简单地整理了一下，已经放在您的桌子上了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210839
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210839,
					"content": "另外，按排程来看，今天还有一场关于发展纺织业的会议…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210840
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210840,
					"content": "排程…现在？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210841
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210841,
					"content": "是的，那两位远道而来的姑娘已经在等您了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210842
					],
					"speakerTitle": "和泉那希"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210842,
					"content": "#好吧…{NICKNAME}，本来想带你好好逛一逛海祇岛，看来要忙完再一起散散心了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210843
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210843,
					"content": "明天我们在珊瑚宫门口碰面吧，然后一起去筹备庆功宴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210844
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210844,
					"content": "庆功宴！会有很多好吃的吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210845
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210845,
					"content": "呵呵…当然有的。有些海祇岛的特色美食，也欢迎你们品尝一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210846
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210846,
					"content": "好耶！那我们明天不见不散啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210847
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210847,
					"content": "嗯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
				},
				{
					"id": 120210832,
					"content": "有点累。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210833
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 120210833,
					"content": "是吧，我也感觉有些头疼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						120210834
					],
					"speakerTitle": "珊瑚宫心海"
